    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>ChatGPT-like LLM Serving</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the system around a large language model: stream answers token by token to 120K people at once, keep very expensive GPUs busy with continuous batching and a paged KV cache, share them fairly with token-based limits, and remember every conversation.</p>\n      "
